    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26062" root="ضن" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضَنَّةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضِنَّةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هٰذَا عِلْقُ مَضَنَّةٍ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضِنَّةٍ</span>
[the former mentioned after the latter in the S]
<i>This is a thing held in high estimation, of which
one is tenacious,</i> (S, K, TA,) <i>and for which people
vie in desire.</i> (TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِرْقٌ</span>, last sentence.]

